### Spring Boot WebClient config

```java
@Bean
public WebClient aiServiceClient() {
    return WebClient.builder()
        .baseUrl("http://ai-service:8000")
        .defaultHeader("X-Internal-Key", System.getenv("INTERNAL_SECRET"))
        .build();
